		{"id":"9492bcd836b869e4","type":"text","text":"**Rendering** - particles are drawn to screen each frame taking in account current attributes and drawing options","x":-12468,"y":6366,"width":868,"height":59},
		{"id":"dae3bde97daf99ba","type":"text","text":"**Modeling** - we define number of particles, their attributes, forces which affect particles and display options.","x":-12468,"y":6458,"width":868,"height":60},
		{"id":"2ece157da80202a8","type":"text","text":"**Particle** - atomic element of particle system which contains attributes (e.g., position, velocity, size, color, etc.)","x":-12468,"y":6185,"width":868,"height":60},
		{"id":"eea8cb858e580116","type":"text","text":"**Keywords**","x":-12468,"y":5989,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"aa5f22a86b88fab1","type":"text","text":"**Particle system** - a collection of separate small objects (particles) that are set into motion using some algorithm","x":-12468,"y":6084,"width":868,"height":65},
		{"id":"6ef6bc1a7a880d5c","type":"text","text":"**Feedback loop** - for each frame, particle attributes are computed using old values and algorithm","x":-12468,"y":6284,"width":868,"height":60},
