		{"id":"f1d0697fd9c32fd2","type":"text","text":"Volumes and particles/points:\n* Volumes are grids (voxels)\n* Particles are points\n\nGreat combination for describing **\"fuzzy\"** objects.\n\n","x":-13663,"y":2400,"width":628,"height":197},
