		{"id":"a123a317eb34085f","type":"text","text":"Point cloud open and filter","x":-5802,"y":3017,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"90c8a934e7eb7822","type":"text","text":"particle system advect by volumes - feedback loop:\n* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/dop/popadvectbyvolumes.html","x":-5363,"y":3077,"width":320,"height":168},
		{"id":"c70cca31a8854343","type":"text","text":"Particle system","x":-5328,"y":2957,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"97877b403da123ca","type":"text","text":"Volume as datas tructure for storing vector field for particles: rasterize volume of surface containing vector field and volume advect in POP for particle simulation\n\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wR0SDptfygg\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yqM_3goH4J8\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rn_8iN7lyjI\n","x":-6873,"y":2396,"width":700,"height":280},
		{"id":"6d52b6b5da9319e8","type":"text","text":"Advection:\n\n* https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advection\n* In the fields of [physics](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Physics \"Physics\"), [engineering](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Engineering \"Engineering\"), and [earth sciences](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth_science \"Earth science\"), **advection** is the [transport](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Transport \"Transport\") of a substance or quantity by bulk motion of a fluid.\n* During advection, a fluid transports some conserved quantity or material via bulk motion. The fluid's motion is described [mathematically](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mathematics \"Mathematics\") as a [vector field](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vector_field \"Vector field\"), and the transported material is described by a [scalar field](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scalar_field \"Scalar field\") showing its distribution over space.","x":-6103,"y":2396,"width":710,"height":280},
		{"id":"1ffecb7d1661528f","type":"text","text":"Cloud shape modeling:\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8vZcrrJQLII\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z3vjJiNBYlg\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-aTwkDn3wpE","x":-6943,"y":4117,"width":510,"height":148},
		{"id":"6376e2e2079b83a7","type":"text","text":"Volumetric morphing using SDF:\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RUxxDc8LM_8\n","x":-6203,"y":4217,"width":522,"height":95},
