		{"id":"0cc94e7f42794135","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/CloudShapeIni.jpg","x":-6810,"y":6559,"width":412,"height":235},
		{"id":"4cafbd2056b1361c","type":"text","text":"Initial Cloud shape using VDB","x":-6733,"y":6415,"width":257,"height":62},
		{"id":"1fd0fb4d0fedad69","type":"text","text":"Convert volume to particles for artistic particle system morphing (advection) using volumetric vector field:\n* It is easier to model forces on particles and then to convert those to volume \n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WySzeEniScs\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wR0SDptfygg","x":-6302,"y":5825,"width":1008,"height":367},
		{"id":"b403b5ce05ca9a2b","type":"text","text":"Volume As particles","x":-6228,"y":6367,"width":257,"height":62},
		{"id":"9894a5cc57684085","type":"text","text":"Volume Vector Field","x":-5727,"y":6367,"width":257,"height":62},
		{"id":"f5bd8c10989bfead","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/CloudAsParticles.jpg","x":-6302,"y":6558,"width":412,"height":234},
		{"id":"1a875dcf86689fba","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/VolumeFromAdvectedParticles.jpg","x":-4234,"y":6540,"width":411,"height":349},
		{"id":"9ee0bd698795d79d","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/ParticleAdvectionUsingVolumeVectorField.jpg","x":-5273,"y":6536,"width":411,"height":334},
		{"id":"dcb79ddc774d9b16","type":"text","text":"Advected particles","x":-5196,"y":6367,"width":257,"height":62},
		{"id":"3c26ac655ad6270f","type":"text","text":"Convert particles to volume and rendering:\n* https://www.sidefx.com/forum/topic/42457/\n* Volume rasterize particles: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/volumerasterizeparticles.html\n* Volume rasterize points: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/volumerasterizepoints.html\n* Volume rasterize attributes: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/volumerasterizeattributes.html + https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wR0SDptfygg\n* Volume color: https://www.sidefx.com/forum/topic/53590/?page=1#post-351635 + https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/sop/paintcolorvolume.html","x":-4862,"y":5825,"width":700,"height":367},
		{"id":"ef6609870b62b613","type":"text","text":"Volume from particles (rasterize volume)","x":-4637,"y":6367,"width":257,"height":62},
		{"id":"da54e356f515b466","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/AdvectedShape.jpg","x":-4714,"y":6540,"width":412,"height":325},
		{"id":"7106d0c466ce6ceb","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/CloudAsParticles.jpg","x":-5804,"y":6560,"width":412,"height":234},
		{"id":"6779dd0c7363a476","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/VolumeVectorField.jpg","x":-5804,"y":6842,"width":411,"height":292},
		{"id":"5b459b413010b506","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/7/StartingShape.jpg","x":-5804,"y":7183,"width":411,"height":289},
		{"id":"9e1f01abd7163374","type":"text","text":"Unity 2022.3.59f1","x":-6383,"y":8056,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6d3937a6c937bc23","type":"text","text":"Explore samples:\n* Unity 2022.3.59f1 VFX Graph samples\n* Analyze default Unity 2022.3.59f1 VFX graph systems\n\t* Heads and trails\n\t* Ribbon\n\t* Heads and sparks\n\t* Mesh output\n* Unity 6 VFX Graph samples","x":-6375,"y":8465,"width":541,"height":280},
		{"id":"b728f8f0548d8b3e","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/1/Sparks.jpg","x":-5734,"y":9197,"width":647,"height":384},
		{"id":"78c37f4d8c1b6dd7","type":"text","text":"Portal VFX effect","x":-6383,"y":9323,"width":300,"height":66},
		{"id":"8316a85248afc115","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/1/4_InitializeSDFPosition.jpg","x":-3403,"y":9842,"width":468,"height":445},
		{"id":"7ac0b867257a56ff","type":"text","text":"3. Initialize: set position using SDF. Also:\n\t* Output: Change particle texture and size\n\t* Spawn&Initialize: Increase rate and capacity\n\t* Configure lifetime\n\nNOTE: If Particles are flickering, click on Update Node and in inspector turn off sorting: https://discussions.unity.com/t/vfx-graph-particles-flickering-in-alpha-blend-mode/235655","x":-3403,"y":10282,"width":468,"height":280},
		{"id":"01f307d43faf1762","type":"text","text":"5. GPU Event Trails:\n\t* Update: add Trigger Event Rate (Over Time)\n\t* Add GPU Event System\n\t\t* Add initialize particle strip Inherit position, lifetime. Add random color\n\t\t* Add update \n\t\t* Add output Particle Strip Line","x":-2363,"y":10313,"width":397,"height":309},
		{"id":"46c0e5afa77a9ff9","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/1/5_UpdateOutputTurbulenceSDFConformColor.jpg","x":-2863,"y":9846,"width":413,"height":459},
		{"id":"9cb7a01f0cd79a9f","type":"text","text":"4. Update: add turbulence force and SDF conform force. Also add in Output: by Speed or location","x":-2863,"y":10305,"width":413,"height":116},
		{"id":"7380bbdc701458bb","type":"text","text":"5. Initialize&Update: normalize initial velocity, add drag, gravity and turbulence","x":-2503,"y":9581,"width":432,"height":74},
		{"id":"eafbaf646a1b85b1","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/1/6_GPUEventTrails.jpg","x":-2363,"y":9846,"width":397,"height":467},
		{"id":"99a8a7663277d405","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/1/SDFTrails_Sparks.jpg","x":-1833,"y":9842,"width":780,"height":463},
		{"id":"3e09c3e2d8cf4a16","type":"link","url":"https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.visualeffectgraph@14.0/manual/sample-content.html","x":-5655,"y":8395,"width":700,"height":420},
		{"id":"9d6133c8e9db358c","type":"link","url":"https://unity.com/blog/unity-6-vfx-graph-ebook","x":-4875,"y":8395,"width":1372,"height":547},
		{"id":"eaa36fb57e1c4efc","type":"file","file":"Images/Fuzzy/LectureExamples/1/6_InitalizeUpdateNormalizeVelocityDragGravityTurbulence.jpg","x":-2503,"y":9197,"width":432,"height":384},
